 "insight": [
  "In 2005, Luxembourg's main product chapters in exports were machinery and mechanical appliances, electrical machinery and equipment, and iron and steel.",
  "The total exports amounted to 15.39 billion euros, with the top three product chapters making up 59.0% of this value.",
  "Machinery and mechanical appliances were the largest export category at 4.13 billion euros, representing 26.8% of exports, followed by electrical machinery and equipment at 3.24 billion euros (21.0%), and iron and steel at 1.72 billion euros (11.2%).",
  "Other products accounted for 19.0% of exports, while confidential exports made up 0.4%.",
  "The values are nominal and not adjusted for price changes, and 2.0% of the export value is confidential at full product detail."
 ],
